Reuse bounded native integer-array hashing for persisted exactness audits

Keep v1 values, dtype and null identities; fall back for mixed, unsupported or oversized cells. Portable exactness checks pass on Windows; compiled numeric-kernel cases are verified on the company Linux runtime.


